  _description: 'Meta-horizon landmark deed (P3-3 demo): the hero once swore the raider''s
    pact (the power side of the barn moral fork; set alongside the run-scoped
    world.raider_offer_taken in RaiderMotive.ink). Persists across deaths so the
    conquest-leaning mirror-lore echo can read the player''s history. The alliance
    lean reuses world.barn_bounty_honored.'
